    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. so you're saying it's more of a fundamental truth rather than a debate. but some people say that kids might just be confused or influenced by what they see online, and that we should wait until they're older to make any big decisions. how would you respond to that? is that view considered wrong or just a different perspective?",
